<title>PORTUGAL: TENNIS-ESTORIL OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ESTORIL OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ESTORIL, Portugal 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the $625,000 Estoril Open men's tennis tournament on Monday (prefix numbers denote seedings):</p>
<p>7-Francisco Clavet (Spain) beat Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) 3-6 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Richard Fromberg (Australia) beat Adrian Voinea (Romania) 4-6 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Frederic Fontang (France) beat Marc-Kevin Goellner (Germany) 7-5 7-5</p>
</text>
